          "evidence": "lib/e/ui/style.e (D805): ThemeTokens with fourteen colour roles, seven text roles, spacing, radii, borders, elevation, motion and metrics; resolve for the seven control states over three variants; size_class and adapt for touch, dense desktop and compact; reference in Light, Dark and HighContrast; tests/selfhost/fixtures/link/ui_theme on both hosts"
