          "evidence": "lib/e/ui/widget.e (D806): Scope with traps_focus bounding Tab/Shift+Tab traversal in preorder with wrapping, up to eight Shortcut entries matched on key and modifiers, Enter as the default action and Escape as the cancel action resolved from the focused element upward; focused() for harnesses; tests/selfhost/fixtures/link/ui_gesture on both hosts"
        },
        {
          "id": "P0-04",
