            "ScrollViewport",
            "LazyViewport"
          ],
          "evidence": "lib/e/ui/widget.e (D808): Scroll with wheel, content drag through the gesture arena (tap-only regions hand over past the slop), per-frame momentum, Clamp/Bounce overscroll with a spring back, a scrollbar thumb, Change[f32] reports, scroll_to/scroll_offset_of; the lazy form places virtual_count items of virtual_extent from virtual_first with visible_range naming the items to build and the reconciler recycling by key; tests/selfhost/fixtures/link/ui_scroll on both hosts"
